{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","竹破苍穹"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","盘坐后对周围敌人造成伤害，之后消耗能量维持“苍竹劲”状态，在“苍竹劲”状态中自身获得攻击力和急速加成，同时解锁技能“封天掌”对单体敌人造成高额伤害并使目标不能恢复能量。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","潘撑起竹竿盘坐运行体内的真气，盘坐结束后体内真气爆发，对附近2格范围的敌人造成350% + 50% ATK的伤害，随后自身将进入“苍竹劲”状态，并且每秒需要消耗150点能量来维持该状态。本技能释放期间，潘获得霸体。 \n处于“苍竹劲”状态时，潘获得60急速和17%攻击力加成，并解锁技能“封天掌”：蓄力后双掌交替拍向对方共7次，每次造成70% ATK的伤害，最后一击伤害增加至150% ATK并使目标眩晕1.5秒；在最后一击时封印其真气流动，使非首领敌人5秒内无法恢复能量。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":43,"end":49,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":39,"end":53,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":104,"end":106,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":167,"end":174,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":187,"end":195,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","真气爆发的伤害提升至380% + 50% ATK，“苍竹劲”状态提供的攻击力加成提升至19%。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","真气爆发的伤害提升至410% + 50% ATK，“苍竹劲”状态提供的攻击力加成提升至21%。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","真气爆发的伤害提升至440% + 50% ATK，“苍竹劲”状态提供的攻击力加成提升至23%。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","真气爆发的伤害提升至470% + 50% ATK，“苍竹劲”状态提供的攻击力加成提升至25%。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","青虹贯日"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","重击敌人造成较高伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","潘重击目标头部，对目标造成300% + 40% ATK伤害；处于“苍竹劲”状态时本技能还会造成目标当前生命值12%的额外伤害，额外伤害不会超过自身240% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":73,"end":81,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至320% + 40% ATK，处于“苍竹劲”状态下造成的额外伤害提高至目标当前生命值的13%，最高不会超过自身260% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":60,"end":68,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至340% + 40% ATK，处于“苍竹劲”状态下造成的额外伤害提高至目标当前生命值的14%，最高不会超过自身280% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":60,"end":68,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至360% + 40% ATK，处于“苍竹劲”状态下造成的额外伤害提高至目标当前生命值的15%，最高不会超过自身300% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":60,"end":68,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","苍竹御敌"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","为自己施加护盾，在护盾持续时间内获得霸体，在护盾结束、被打破或叠加时对敌人造成伤害。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时蓄力，之后获得一个340% + 40% ATK的苍竹护盾持续9秒，苍竹护盾存在时提供霸体效果。当苍竹护盾消失、被打破或与已有的苍竹护盾叠加时，将幻化成绿叶飞向当前攻击的目标，对其造成潘210% + 30% ATK的伤害；蓄力过程中潘处于霸体状态。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":24,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":101,"end":107,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":47,"end":49,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":97,"end":111,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":123,"end":125,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","获得的护盾量提升至380% + 40% ATK，绿叶造成的伤害提升至230% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":19,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":38,"end":44,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":34,"end":48,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","获得的护盾量提升至420% + 40% ATK，绿叶造成的伤害提升至250% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":19,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":38,"end":44,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":34,"end":48,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","获得的护盾量提升至460% + 40% ATK，绿叶造成的伤害提升至270% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":19,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":38,"end":44,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":34,"end":48,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身攻击力。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身攻击力提升9%，“苍竹劲”状态期间额外提升6%攻击力。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身攻击力提升12%，“苍竹劲”状态期间额外提升8%攻击力。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身攻击力提升15%，“苍竹劲”状态期间额外提升10%攻击力。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","同心共气"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","苍竹护盾生效期间额外提供攻击力加成。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","苍竹护盾存在期间，其携带者的攻击力提升15%。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","苍竹护盾存在期间，其携带者的攻击力提升17%。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","潘能感知场上的“真气”并在适当时候支援场上的友方英雄，每当自身以外的友方英雄能量到达850及以上时，使其获得苍竹护盾，该效果对同一名角色每15秒最多触发一次。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","苍竹护盾存在期间，其携带者的攻击力提升19%。"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","“苍竹劲”状态时获得额外防御穿透；进入“苍竹劲”状态后立刻获得苍竹护盾。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","处于“苍竹劲”状态时获得30点防御穿透；进入“苍竹劲”状态后立刻获得苍竹护盾。"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","苍竹杖"]]}